## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- No automated tests are currently set up. We rely on manual verification.

### Manual Verification
1. Log in as an existing Farmer with an incomplete profile.
2. Verify that I am immediately redirected to the `Complete Your Profile` page.
3. Fill out the Personal Information section and verify the circular progress bar updates and changes color.
4. Upload an image for the Farm Images section, ensuring the preview works and the backend successfully saves the file.
5. Attempt to submit the profile while incomplete (should be disabled or show error).
6. Complete all mandatory sections and submit, verifying the status changes to "Verification Pending" and a success animation is shown.
